{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1211124001:0":{"text":"そう、ここは夢の世界。そしてお宝が隠されている場所でもあるの！あなたたちはこの島に上陸した瞬間から、アルマスの夢の中にいるのよ。","source_cn":"这里确实是梦境，也是藏宝之地。从你们登上小岛的那一刻起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8CC6964D297533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211124002:0":{"text":"アルマスって……あの木のことですか？","source_cn":"奥曼斯……不是那棵树吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D19AA8FC8FB6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211124003:0":{"text":"あら、記憶力がいいハムスターちゃんね！","source_cn":"哎呀，真可爱！你的记性真好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66154FBE54395BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211124004:0":{"text":"それじゃ、改めて自己紹介するわね。あたしはここの守護妖精<style=\"highlight\">夢の守人</style>タシーよ。","source_cn":"那么，让我重新做个自我介绍吧。我是这里的保卫者，<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81868C628A1BD2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211124005:0":{"text":"テルミリウス様の命により、アルマスとここで浪と漂流の神が夢の中に隠したお宝を守っているの。","source_cn":"奉特勒米琉斯的嘱托，我和奥曼斯在此地守护着风浪与漂泊之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB98A0C209A03D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docume